Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:22.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs45\c&H412E2F&\pos(1185,578)\frz2.806}完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:26.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\p1\alpha0\pos(182,394)}m 0 0 l 0 600 l 950 600 l 950 0
